name yardstick_150_high_jitter_seed5
describe high_jitter with every v2 switch on, seed 5: a traced copy so libwebrtc's bwe trace for this seed is on parity-data (issue #150)
# Yardstick only (no expectations): sm_compare traces this scenario (kDefaultTraced), one seed, both stacks.
# Our target overshoots libwebrtc's on seeds 5 and 10 (64-65 % utilization against 30.8 and 42.9 %).
seed 5
compare_seeds 1
cc v2
pacer v2
tcc v2
rtx v2
rtcp v2
keyframe v2
allocator v2
packetization v2
audio v2
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=3000kbps delay=30ms jitter=40ms reorder=on queue=300ms
